r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, August to September is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, with a normal of 6.51 inches, and it came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years since 1951. On the middle of the grids, November to December 2025 came in at 47% of normal, and February to March 2026 came in at 33%. Grids 15456 and 15756 both had their driest year in 2010, at 57% of normal.</p>"}
